# The build context for deploy/image/Dockerfile, which is the product ROOT - so what is excluded here is
# what would otherwise be streamed to the daemon on every build.
#
# `.git` IS NOT EXCLUDED, deliberately and against the usual advice: setuptools-scm derives the kernel's
# version from the git tag, so a context without it produces a wheel labelled with the no-tag sentinel
# and an image whose version is a guess. Measured on this tree: 28 MB of history against a 0.6 MB source
# tree, once per build, and the alternative (passing the number in as a build argument) is the second
# source for one number that si#200 removed.
#
# The venv is the entry that matters: deploy/orchestrator/.venv holds an installed toolchain and dwarfs
# everything else in the repository.
deploy/orchestrator/.venv
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
